\title{Design notes}

\p{Design notes for the RLVM machine, the reference engine, the loader and store, the driver and the platform, and the reviews of those designs. A note describes how a part is meant to work and why; its sections are addressable subtrees, and it links to the document of the repository that carries the detail. The notes are listed collapsed, in a reading order.}

